unheaded (0.2.0~alpha) unheaded; urgency=medium

  * Packages built by scripts/build-all-debs.sh from one table
    (scripts/lib/deb-packages.sh): every binary a deploy/systemd unit runs,
    plus unheaded-keygen and unheaded-configs.
  * unheaded-daemon replaces unheaded-unheaded-daemon; units ship under the
    repository's unit names; a renamed unit keeps its enabled and running
    state across the upgrade.
  * Published from the signed apt repository on west (scripts/apt-repo.sh).

